{
  "$description": "PRESET: dense. The same colours on a tighter grid and a smaller type scale — a data-heavy product's starting position. THE FLOOR IS STILL 12px; nothing below it ships. Copy one preset to your token file, change the PRIMITIVE tier, and regenerate — the semantic tier follows because it aliases rather than repeats. The design system's source of truth, in the Design Tokens Community Group format (first stable version, 2025.10). Three tiers: primitive (the ramps — THE KNOBS) → semantic (what a component asks for) → component (design/components.css). Generate design/tokens.css with `node design/tokens-to-css.mjs`; never hand-edit the CSS. A mode override rides on the token it overrides.",
